<title>USA: Ithaca Industries Feb 1 10-week period shr $0.28.</title>
<headline>Ithaca Industries Feb 1 10-week period shr $0.28.</headline>
<dateline>WILKESBORO, N.C. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ithaca Industries Inc said Tuesday it posted a net loss of $2.8 million or $0.28 a share for the 10-week period since it emerged from bankruptcy.</p>
<p>It said sales totaled $42.7 million, including $6 million from discontinued products, for the period ended February 1.</p>
<p>The company emerged from Chapter 11 bankruptcy in December.</p>
